Keep exec usable with older pod servers

Fall back to enter's container transport when the pod server has no exec
endpoint, so connected pods remain usable after a host-side upgrade.
Preserve stdin until execution is accepted, and retain arguments,
terminal selection, working directory, environment, and exit status
in the fallback.
Other failures remain errors because retrying could run a command twice.
Cover fallback behavior and non-retryable errors in CLI tests.
